    "explanation": "How Change Saga's data fits together end to end. Persisted in the repository: the change.saga folder's records (manifest, features, personas, stories and criteria, decks, slides, Items, code references, technical definitions, reviews and merge records). In Git: the source repository and its commits, the only copy of the code. Derived on read and never stored in the Saga: the change set, coverage report, reconciliation queue and query responses, plus the disposable reviewer snapshot cache in the user cache directory. Dashed boxes and arrows mark derived data; relations and review decisions are in the directory but not drawn.",
    "name": "Change Saga data model",
    "record": "urn:change-saga:change-saga:erd:application",
